# Recordings go through Git LFS.
#
# Nothing here reaches this repository: `.gitignore` keeps every `.wav` out of
# it, and the seeded demo episodes are rebuilt rather than committed. This file
# exists for the deployment branch, where they must be committed — Hugging Face
# builds the image from the pushed repository rather than from an image built
# here, so an episode that is not in git is an episode the Space never sees.
#
# LFS rather than plain git because the Hub refuses files over 10 MB on the
# regular path, and four minutes of 24 kHz mono is about 12 MB.
*.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
